data: {"id": "ff0aadc7acc4454b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1109", "run_id": "ff0aadc7acc4454b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的真实工具结果，以下是对 `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9` 的根因证据分析：\n\n### 1. 已确认事实 (Evidence)\n*   **Pod 状态持续异常**：Pod 仍处于 `Pending` 阶段，Container Status 为 `Waiting`，Reason 为 `CreateContainerConfigError`。\n*   **具体错误信息明确**：`kubectl_get_yaml` 返回的 `containerStatuses` 中 `message` 字段指出：`couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`。\n*   **配置不匹配**：\n    *   Pod 的 Container Spec (由 `jsonpath` 提取) 声明环境变量引用了 Secret `workload-input` 中的 key `unavailable-key` (`secretKeyRef.name: wor", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 7, "ts_ms": 1789057379243, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

